Comment: 0,0:22:43.74,0:22:48.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑著並稍微落淚
Comment: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:51.88,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}我的存在意義
Comment: 0,0:22:51.88,0:22:58.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}將由你的雙手重新塑造
